## Context

Roar sweep finding after the 0251 entry-point consolidation. Ticket 0293
replaced raid Phase 5's "follows `/hunt` workflow" paraphrase with a
mechanical `Skill(hunt)` invocation, because paraphrases drift. The same
shape survives in `skills/hunt/SKILL.md` step 11: "Review according to
`/review-pr`" — an executing agent may paraphrase the review procedure
instead of invoking the skill. `review-pr` already has
`disable-model-invocation: false`, so the mechanical call works today.

## Relevant files
- `skills/hunt/SKILL.md` — step 11
- `skills/raid/SKILL.md` — Phase 5, the pattern to mirror (ticket 0293)

## Actions
1. Reword step 11 to an imperative, greppable invocation:
   `Skill(skill: "review-pr", args: <pr-number>)`.
2. Extend `tests/test_raid_invokes_hunt.py` (or a sibling guard) to pin
   the phrasing, mirroring the 0293 guard.

## Test
- Guard test RED on "according to `/review-pr`", GREEN after.

